{"4022950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nature of Dread", "steam_appid": 4022950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/7226b178e50a557c32ba0826be2879ba.avif?t=1786714182\" width=1024 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught in the wrong place at the wrong time, you awaken in the classified settlement of Hellhole. Built as humanity’s final bulwark in a war that has raged for over a millennium, it was designed to contain an ancient evil.<br>Here, in desperate attempts to stop it, people tried to contain it, isolate it, and study it—only for decades of military experiments to bury the truth even deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The borders of the settlement were sealed tight, access was forbidden, and everything that happened—and still happens—within its perimeter remains buried beneath layers of secrecy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, thrust into this centuries-old conflict, you must decide how far you are willing to go to protect what truly matters to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a nightmare given flesh, fight for your life, and uncover the horrifying truth about the nature of this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deep Atmospheric Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/ce105a2e193d5cca49f7d4efb34b8148.poster.avif?t=1786714182\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/ce105a2e193d5cca49f7d4efb34b8148.webm?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/ce105a2e193d5cca49f7d4efb34b8148.mp4?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a layered story where every location and every character carries weight. Step into the bone-chilling silence of the northern forests, become an unwilling guest of honor at Satan’s blood-soaked ball, and come face to face with beings worthy of the Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Threats That Evolve and Strike Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/132f4a1fb211813bd58ed17fad8d517b.poster.avif?t=1786714182\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/132f4a1fb211813bd58ed17fad8d517b.webm?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/132f4a1fb211813bd58ed17fad8d517b.mp4?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the spawn of primordial evil. In a world governed by its own cruel laws, its creatures hunt with cunning intent—they learn, adapt, form packs, and change tactics the moment they sense your next move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Realistic Weaponry System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/e9fad0c59e530c002876185fdf10eaf8.poster.avif?t=1786714182\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/e9fad0c59e530c002876185fdf10eaf8.webm?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/e9fad0c59e530c002876185fdf10eaf8.mp4?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the difference between a jury-rigged sawed-off shotgun and a standard-issue military pistol. Sense the knife blade bite into flesh, catch on bone, or slip from blood-slick fingers. Smart gear choices and careful resource management will be your greatest advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Eternal Dread Reborn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/cdde6274aa27160303cf94a483ca6e7c.poster.avif?t=1786714182\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/cdde6274aa27160303cf94a483ca6e7c.webm?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/cdde6274aa27160303cf94a483ca6e7c.mp4?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an authentic, soul-freezing descent into a world of absolute darkness, where nightmares are born. Discover the very nature of fear—distilled from the greatest works of dark fiction and sharpened through modern survival-horror design.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/7226b178e50a557c32ba0826be2879ba.avif?t=1786714182\" width=1024 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught in the wrong place at the wrong time, you awaken in the classified settlement of Hellhole. Built as humanity’s final bulwark in a war that has raged for over a millennium, it was designed to contain an ancient evil.<br>Here, in desperate attempts to stop it, people tried to contain it, isolate it, and study it—only for decades of military experiments to bury the truth even deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The borders of the settlement were sealed tight, access was forbidden, and everything that happened—and still happens—within its perimeter remains buried beneath layers of secrecy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, thrust into this centuries-old conflict, you must decide how far you are willing to go to protect what truly matters to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a nightmare given flesh, fight for your life, and uncover the horrifying truth about the nature of this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deep Atmospheric Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/ce105a2e193d5cca49f7d4efb34b8148.poster.avif?t=1786714182\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/ce105a2e193d5cca49f7d4efb34b8148.webm?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/ce105a2e193d5cca49f7d4efb34b8148.mp4?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a layered story where every location and every character carries weight. Step into the bone-chilling silence of the northern forests, become an unwilling guest of honor at Satan’s blood-soaked ball, and come face to face with beings worthy of the Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Threats That Evolve and Strike Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/132f4a1fb211813bd58ed17fad8d517b.poster.avif?t=1786714182\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/132f4a1fb211813bd58ed17fad8d517b.webm?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/132f4a1fb211813bd58ed17fad8d517b.mp4?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the spawn of primordial evil. In a world governed by its own cruel laws, its creatures hunt with cunning intent—they learn, adapt, form packs, and change tactics the moment they sense your next move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Realistic Weaponry System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/e9fad0c59e530c002876185fdf10eaf8.poster.avif?t=1786714182\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/e9fad0c59e530c002876185fdf10eaf8.webm?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022950/extras/e9fad0c59e530c002876185fdf10eaf8.mp4?t=1786714182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >